<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rawma Mozy</book>
  <para style="h">Rawma Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rawma Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rawma Mozy</para>
  <para style="mt">Rawma Mozy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawla, Zisu Krista chakaotuhpa, lyuhchâpa châ awpa ta awpa nata Khazohpa thâtihpha châta pananopa ta, he châpaphaopa he a roh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cha thâtihpha cha, Khazohpa ta a hrohsopazy hmâpa ta hlâno tawhta Biehrai pathaihpa liata bie â vaw taih hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cha thâtihpha cha a Sawchapawpa, eima Beipa Zisu Krista thâtih châ ta, sapa kyh liata cha Dâvi pathla ta a pihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A Thlahpa pathaihna kyh liata deikua cha, athihpa hry tawhta a thyuheihna ta, eima Beipa Zisu Krista cha hmotaotheina a hneipa Khazohpa Sawchapawpa a châzie a palâsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ano vâta nata ano moh ta phopi to pangiapâsa ta, a bie pazyhsa awpa ta, ngiachhiena nata lyuhchâpa châna eima hmô.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha chata nâmo, Rawma khih liata a ypa, Zisu Krista eih châ awpa ta awpa zydua chhao a cha pahly ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rawma khihpi liata Khazohpa kyhpachâpazy nata a mopathaihpazy châ awpa ta a awpa zydua ei châ naoh ei. Khazohpa eima Paw nata Abeipa Zisu Krista tawhta ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna nama hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hmiatua chai ta, namâ ngiapâna kyh Khizaw zydua liata a pathâhpa vâta, nama zydua châta Zisu Krista moh ta ei Khazohpa lâ alyna bie ei reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nama moh reipa ta bâh leipa ta thlah ei cha chhâpa tyh ei. Cha kyh liata, a Sawchapawpa thâtihpha raihria liata ei thlahpa ta ei chakaopa Khazohpa cha nâ pahnokheituhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khazohpa ta â ryh tah sala, tahmâ lia chhâ heta cha, cha vaw tly thei awpa ei ta khâ ei hiah tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nama pachyu thei nawpa ta Thlahpa hmopiepa cha pahneisa awpa ei ta, nâmo châ hmô awpa ei khoh ngaita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatanachata namâ ngiapâna nata ei ngiapâna hmâpa ta, eimâ ngiapâna tha eimâ patlô raihrie thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nâmo nata Zenitai hropazy hry liata theilâpa hmô awpa ta, cha vaw tly awpa ei a chhuah tyh na ta, châhrasala pakhâna a y chhyh hapa kyh nama pahno lei awpa khoh va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krikâh mo nata mohropazy, asopa nata ahrupazy liata a bâhpa ei hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chavâta nâmo, Rawma khih liata a ypazy hnoh chhao ta, thâtihpha cha chho awpa a ngiatiah va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thâtihpha cha zakhei tlôh lei khâh na ta. Ahy rai a ngiapâpa maih châta pachha châ nawpa ta Khazohpa hmotaotheina châ tlôh ta, a hmiatua ta Zu chyhsa châta châ ta, Krikâh mo châta chhao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mosiapa cha ngiapâna ta a hroh aw,” tahpa ropa hawhta, thâtihpha liana chata Khazohpa siana a vaw luah ta, cha siana cha âthaona tawhta achhâna taihta ngiapâna vâta a ypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khazohpa a pachâ leipa nata chyhsa sia leipa zydua chô liata Khazohpa pathiiana avâ tawhta a zâ luah. Âmo cha ama sialeina vâta biehmeiseihpa a pakhâtuhpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khazohpa thâtih pahno awpa cha âmo liata a sia thlâh haw. Cha cha Khazohpa tlai ta a pahnosa ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mo ta hmô thei leipa a châna, a chhâzaw hmotaotheina nata a Khazoh châna zy cha, khizaw tao tua no tawhta hmôpa ta y ta, hmotaopazy liata a siapa ta â lâ. Chavâta rei nawpa hnei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khazohpa cha pahno taraw ei ta, châhrasala Khazohpa hawhta palyupalih leipa ei ta, alyna bie hlâ hra veih ei. Hmo hraoleipa tlao pachâ via ei ta, ama pathipalôh hruna cha a vaw zoh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chyhsa sopa hawhta a reih ei ta, ahrupa lâta ama pua haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chatanachata thi thei leipa Khazohpa rônahna cha, thi theipa chyhsazy, pavawzy, phei palihpa sazy nata alyhpasa nothlahpazy hawhta ama pachâsa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chavâta ama pôhpa nozachhih ngaitapa ta a tao raihrie awpa ta, ama pathipalôh aohraohna hawhta hmo puapa tao awpa ta Khazohpa ta â heihsai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khazohpa biehmeiseihpa cha haipa ta pachâsapa ta, Taotuhpa a chhy leipa ei ta, a hmotaopazy a chhypa ta ama chakao. Taotuhpa cha chhâzaw ta reithaipa ta y mawh sy! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha vâna chata Khazohpa ta nozachhih ngaitapa ta sihryh awpa ta âmo cha â heihsai ha ei. Ama chanôzy ta chanô chapaw châna hmâzie tyhpa siesaipa ta, hmâzie lei awpa ta hmâh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chapawzy chhao ta, chanô liata hmâ tyhpa cha siesaipa ta, chapaw nata chapaw a patla ei ta, chapawzy ta nozana châh pahno leipa ta ama chapaw heihzy ykhei ei ta, ama pôhpa lia tlai ta ama moleina ty cha ama hmô.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khazohpa pahnopa cha hmo phahnai leipa hawhta ama pachâpa vâta, palôh doleipa phaoh ta, tao lei awpazy tao awpa ta Khazohpa ta âmo cha â heihsai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chatanachata sialeina chi to, apatlana, chhoruna, karâyna nata kiaphaona zy ta bie ei ta, hiatliana, lianycheina, ahryuna, dôveina, nôchhiena nata kyhchhie reina zy ta ama bie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chyhsa a reipachhiepa, Khazohpa a haopa, a patahsapa, a palaipa, a pahôpahâhpa, moleina khaohvâh a pahnopa, nôpaw rei a ngiah leipa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ahrupa, ngiapâ leipa, palôh a hnei leipa nata zawngiahna a hnei leipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cha hawhpa hmo a taopazy cha, a thi tlâh ama châ tahpa Khazohpa bieraopa pahno thlâh hana chôta, âmo taopa dei châ leipa ta, mohropazy taopa chhao amâ lykhei tyh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta Hy chyhsapa, nâ, mohropa a sei thaipa, rei awpa rai hnei va chi. Mohropa na seina liana tlai khata, nâmasasyh ta thailei nâ pachâsa haw, nâ, seituhpa tlai chhao chi kha, cha hawhpa hmozy a tao tyhpa na châ hrapa vâta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cha hawhpa hmo a tao tyhpazy chô liata Khazohpa pachiana a tlô thlupa cha, a châ awpa tlai na a châ tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hy chyhsapa, cha hawhpa hmo a tao tyhpazy a seituhpa y, nâ chhao kha, cha hawhta tao hra tlôh chi ta, Khazohpa pachiana khôkhâh nâ pangiasa ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A châ vei khiah, Khazohpa phana cha rona lâ châ chhi awpa a châpa pahno leipa ta, a phana hluhzie nata a nôphazie nata a palôh pasizie zy cha, hraoleipa hawhta ma na pachâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na palôh kuhchhana nata ro khoh leina vâta, hiehâhna noh, Khazohpa pachiana siapa â vaw luahna noh châta, nâmasasyh ta hiehâhna nâ pachôpakhy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khazohpa ta chyhsa to ama hmotaopa lymâ hawhta a pachia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmopha tao hualuapa ta, rônahna nata palyupalihna nata thi khao leina a tluatuhpazy hnohta chhâzaw hrona a pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Âmo pha nawpa sai tluapa ta, biehmeiseihpa zyh leipa ta, sialeina a zyhtuhpazy chô lia deikua cha, pathiiana nata hiehâhna a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moleina a taopa chyhsa to chô liata rietheipasana nata pachârôhna vaw tlô aw ta, Zu chyhsa chô liata tlô tua aw ta, Krikâh chyhsa chô liata chhao a tlô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmopha a taotuhpa chô liata deikua cha, rônahna nata palyupalihna nata thlalôhna zy vaw tlô aw ta, Zu chyhsa chô liata tlô tua aw ta, Krikâh chyhsa chô liata chhao a tlô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khazohpa cha khokhei viapa hnei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ryhpa hnei leipa ta hmo a paraopazy cha, ryhpa leipa ta leidia aw ei ta; ryhpa hneina chôta hmo a paraopazy cha, ryhpa ta pachiapa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ryhpa bie a theituhpa maihta Khazohpa mohmô ta asiapazy châ hlei leipa ei ta, ryhpa bie a zyhtuhpazy deita thai pachâsapa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ryhpa a hnei leipa Zenitaizy ta ama pikheipa chhie nata pha pahnona hmâpa ta, ryhpa ta â hnawpazy ama tao tyh. Chavâta ryhpa ama hnei leipa chhao ta, cha cha âmo châta ryhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryhpa raihria cha ama palôh liata ropa a châzie palâsa ei ta, cha cha ama chhie nata pha pahnona ta pahnokhei ta, ama pachâna hmâpa ta a châh ta thailei a pachâ ei ta, a châh ta thai ama pachâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thâtihpha ei reipa hawhna heta, Khazohpa ta Krista Zisu hmâpa ta chyhsapa bieruzy a pachia noh liata, cha hawhna chata a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachâ teh, nâ Zu chyhsa a tah chi ta, ryhpa a ngâchhâ chi ta, Khazohpa nâ palaikhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ryhpa pachupa na châpa vâta, Khazohpa khopa pahno chi ta, hmo phapa chhao nâ pyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mochaopa a chhihtha awpa nata zohna liata a ypazy châta khaihna na châpa nâ pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pahnona nata biehmeiseihpa yna ryhpa na hneipa vâta, ahrupazy pasotuhpa nata hawtizy pachutuhpa ta nâ pachâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha hawhpa na châ hnohkua cha, nâ, mohropazy pachutuhpa, nâmasasyh ta a pachu va chi mâ? Nâ, paru lei awpa biechhotuhpa, na paru tyh ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nâ, aphei awpa châ vei a tahtuhpa, nâ phei tyh ma? Nâ, khazoh nothlahpazy a haotuhpa, khazoh nothlahpa achhyna o liata hmozy na paru tyh ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nâ, ryhpa a palaikheipa, ryhpa paraopa ta Khazohpa moh na pachhie tyh ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nâmo vâta Khazohpa moh cha Zenitaizy hry liata reipachhiepa ta a y,” tahpa ta ropa hawhna khata a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ryhpa na zyh khiahta cha, chopawtaipa cha phahnaina a hnei. Ryhpa na parao khiahta deikua cha, na chopawtaipa cha tai leipa hawhta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chopawtaileipa chyhsa ta ryhpa bieraopazy a zyh khiahta cha, a chopawtaileipa cha taipa hawhta pachâpa châ aw vei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chavâta a pôhpa liata chopawtai leipa, châhrasala ryhpa a zyh pakipa chata, nâ, ryhpa bie ropa ta a hneipa nata chopawtaipa, châhrasala ryhpa a paraotuhpa chi cha, thailei a cha pachâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chôpho dei ta Zu a châpa cha Zu hmeiseihpa châ leipa ta, chôpho ta sapa dei chopawtaipa chhao chopawtai hmeiseihpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zu châna cha chyhsa chhôh liata y ta, chopawtaina cha palôh liata a y, châbie ta chopawtaipa châ leipa ta, Thlahpa ta taipa tlao a châ. Cha hawhpa chyhsa cha, chyhsapa reithaina hlao leipa ta, Khazohpa reithaina a hlao tyh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, Zu chyhsa châpa cha phahnaina khâpa a hnei? Chopawtaipa chhao cha khâpa athôhna a hnei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kyh to liata a phahnai. A phahnaina chaipa cha, Khazohpa biezy pavaosapa ama châpa he a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thokha ngâchhih leipa ei sala, kheihta a châ aw? Âmo ngâchhih leina chata Khazohpa ngâchhihna hraoleipa ta a tao aw ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châ bao va! Chyhsa zydua a haihpa châ hra ei sala, Khazohpa cha adopa a châ, Biehrai liata, “Na bie ta thai châ la, Pachiapa ta na y tita, Pahniena to mah y,” tahpa ta ropa hawhna khata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Châhrasala keimo sialeina ta Khazohpa siana a palâsa khiahta cha, khâpa eima reih khao aw? Eima chô liata a hiehâhna a patlôsana kyh liata, Khazohpa cha sialeipa a châ ma? Cha cha chyhsapa lâ tawhta ei reipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Châ bao va! Chata a châ khiahta cha, Khazohpa ta kheihta khizaw a pachia thei aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei ta haipa bie ei reipa vâta, Khazohpa biehmeiseihpa cha ano parônahsana taihta â lâ khiahta cha, khazia moleipa hawhta thailei pachâsapa ta ei y?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chyhsa thokha ta, “‘Hmo phapa a vaw pua thei nawpa ta, hmo moleipa tao ei suh u,’ ama tah na,” tahpa ta â doleipa ta miah ama baipa hawhna khata eima tao thlâh ha aw ma? Cha hawhpa chyhsazy cha thailei a châ awpa rai ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, keimo Zuzy pi he Krikâh mo hlâta eima pha via hlei ma? Châ bao va! Zuzy chhao, Krikâh mo chhao, moleina sei liata a ypa eima châ khaizie eima rei hapa kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biehrai liata, “Ahy hmah a siapa y veih ei, Pakha hmah y veih ei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahy hmah a pahno thaipa y veih ei, Ahy hmah Khazohpa a tluapa y veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama zydua ta pavia khai ha ei ta, Phahnai leipa ama châ khai haw; Hmo pha a taopa y veih ei, Pakha hmah y veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama rao cha thlâ a pahypa châ ta, Ama paleih dôna bie reina châta hmâh ei ta, Ama hmao liata parih châmaih a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama pakah cha chhiesana nata ruchhôna ta a bie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thisaih palo awpa ta ama phei chatlie kaw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama lâpizy liata raona nata rietheina a y;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlalôhna lâpi pahno veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama mo liata Khazohpa china rai y vei,” tahpa ta ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ryhpa ta a reipa maih cha, ryhpa ry liata a ypazy hnohta reipa a châ tahpa eima pahno. Chatanachata pakah to hmao mopa ta y aw ei ta, khizaw zydua he Khazohpa ryureina ry liata a y thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ryhpa vâta moleina pahnona vaw y ta, chavâta chyhsapa ahy hmahta hmotaopa vâta Khazohpa mohmô ta thaichâ thei aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Châhrasala ryhpa nata hrohsopazy reipa hawhta, ryhpa leipa ta Khazohpa siana cha tahmâ paluahsapa ta a y haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cha Khazohpa siana cha, Zisu Krista amâ ngiapâpa vâta ngiapâtuhpa zydua hnohta paluahsapa ta a y. Ananona rai y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chyhsa zydua ta molei khai ha ei ta, Khazohpa rônahna to thei khao veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cha moleipazy cha, Zisu Krista chatlaina vâta, a ngiachhiena ta a saipa ta thai pachâsapa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zisu Krista cha molei reihpha cheina châta a thisaih palo awpa ta Khazohpa ta a raopa châ ta, cha ngiahthaina cha ngiapâna vâta hmô theipa a châ. A nôphana vâta, kha hlâta moleinazy cha, Khazohpa ta pahno lei a pachâ ta, a siana cha a paluahsa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zisu Krista cha mosiapa a châ thei nawpa nata ano ngiapâtuhpa châta thaipachâsatuhpa a châ thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa ta tahmâhlâ daihti liana heta Zisu Krista siana cha a vaw palâsapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, eimâ palaikhei kawpa kha khataih liata a y haw? Thypa ta a y haw. Khâpa ryhpa ta maw? Hmotaopa ryhpa ta ma? Châ vei, ngiapâna ryhpa ta tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ryhpa hmotaopazy vâta châ leipa ta, chyhsapa cha ngiapâna vâta thai a châpa ta eima rao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khazohpa cha Zuzy Khazohpa dei ma a châ? Zenitaizy Khazohpa chhao châ hra vei ma? A châ tlaih, Zenitaizy Khazohpa a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khazohpa cha pakha a châpa vâta, chopawtaipa cha ngiapâna vâta thaichâ aw ta, chopawtaileipa chhao, ngiapâna vâta thai a châ hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, ngiapâna vâta ryhpa cha hraoleipa ta eima pachâsa ma? Châ bao va! Ryhpa cha tlao eima pa-ipa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, sapa ryhpa ta miah pathlatuhpa Abarahâ kha, khâpa hmo a hmôpa hawhta ma eima reih aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abarahâ kha hmotaopa vâta thai pachâsapa a châ khiahta cha, a palai nawpa a hnei, Khazohpa hmiakô lia deikua cha hnei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biehrai ta kheihta ma a reih? “Abarahâ cha Khazohpa a ngiapâ ta, cha ngiapâna cha a siana ta raopa a châ,” a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Raihriatuhpa hlao cha ngiachhiena hawhta pachâpa châ leipa ta, a bâhpa hawhta pachâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rai a hria leipa chhao ta, moleipazy thai a pachâsatuhpa a ngiapâpa cha, â ngiapâna cha siana ta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmotaopa vâta châ leipa ta, Khazohpa ta mosiapa ta a raopa nohlaona kyh cha, Dâvi chhao ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ama paraonazy a ngiahthaipa châ ta, Ama moleinazy khupa ta a ypazy cha, Ama nohlao na;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa ta moleina hnei leipa ta a raopa cha, A nohlao na,” tahpa ta a vaw reih haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abarahâ ngiapâna cha a siana ta raopa a châ, eima tah tlôh khiahta cha, cha nohlaona cha chopawtaipazy châ deita ma, chopawtai leipazy châta chhao maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abarahâ kha khâpa vâta ma mosiapa ta raopa a châ? Chopawtaipa a châ tawhta ma, tai hlâta maw? Chopawtaipa a châ tawhta châ leipa ta, chopawtai hlâ tawhta mosiapa ta rao hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chopawtaileipa a châ nota, mosiapa a châna pa-i nawpa ta, chopawtaipa ngiana cha ngiapâna ta hmô ta. Cha chata â chhuahpa cha, chopawtaileipa zydua paw ta tao ta, âmo chhao mosiapa ta raopa ama châ thei nawpa ta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chopawtaipazy chhao chopawtai thlâhthlipazy châ leipa ta, miah pathlatuhpa Abarahâ chopawtaipa a châ hlâta â ngiapâna pheihnie a pazituhpa ama châ thei nawpa ta, ano cha chopawtaipazy paw ta taopa a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ano cha khizaw ryu a to awpa a châna kyh, Abarahâ nata a pathlazy hnohta a vaw tlôpa bietai kha, ryhpa vâta a vaw tlôpa châ leipa ta, ngiapâna ta siana vâta a vaw tlôpa tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ryhpa a zyhtuhpazy ta ryutotuhpazy ama châ awpa khiahta cha, ngiapâna cha hraoleipa châ aw ta, bietai chhao aruapa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryhpa ta pathiiana tlôkhei tyh ta, ryhpa y leina liata paraona y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chavâta bietai cha ngiachhiena liata a pahnieh ta, a pathla zydua châta pa-ipa a châ thei nawpa ta, ngiapâna ta a vaw tlôpa a châ. Ryhpa a hneipazy dei châ leipa ta, Abarahâ ngiapâna a hlykheituhpazy chhao ta ama hmô hra aw. Ano cha eima zydua paw a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Phopi hluhpi paw ta ei cha tao haw,” tahpa ta ropa hawhta, Abarahâ cha athihpa a pahrotuhpa nata hmo a y leipazy a paysatuhpa châ ta, â ngiapâpa Khazohpa mohmô liata eima zydua paw a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Cha hawhna chata na pathlazy ama y aw,” tahpa ta chhopa a châpa hawhta, phopi hluhpi paw châ awpa ta, hnabeiseih â chhih leipa chhao ta, ngiapâna ta khâchâ hnabeiseih lymâ ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kô za kha châ daihmâ ha ta, a pôhpa pachâpa ta, athipa hawhta a châ ha bâpa chhao ta nata Sârâ chhi a choh hapa chhao ta, ngiapâna kyh liata thachhâpa ta y beih vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngiapâna a phahla beih leipa ta, Khazohpa bietai a lôh leipa ta y beih vei. Â ngiapâna a thatlô via rili ta, Khazohpa a palyupalih lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khazohpa cha a bietai hawhta a tao thei tahpa khâchâ a ngiapâ ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chavâta â ngiapâna cha a siana ta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“A siana ta raopa a châ,” tahpa biezy cha ano châ dei ropa châ leipa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />keimo châta chhao a châ. Athihpa hry tawhta eima Beipa Zisu a pathyutuhpa cha eimâ ngiapâ khiahta cha, keimo chhao mosiapa ta raopa eima châ hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cha Zisu cha keimo moleina vâta thie awpa ta patusapa châ ta, thai eima châ nawpa ta pathyupa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta ngiapâna vâta thai eima châ ha tawhta cha, eima Beipa Zisu Krista zawhzi ta Khazohpa nata a ryhpa ta eima y haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ano vâ lilaw ta tahmâ ta eimâ duana ngiachhiena liana heta ngiapâna ta a ngia ha pi ta, Khazohpa rônahna hnabeiseihpa ta a lypa ta eima y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cha dei châ vei, eima rietheina liata chhao a lypa ta eima y. Rietheina ta tiamana tao ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tiamana ta hrozie phapa tao ta, hrozie phapa ta hnabeiseihna a tao tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlahpa Pathaihpa miah a piepa khata Khazohpa kyhpachâna eima pathipalôh liata a hry hapa vâta, cha hnabeiseihna chata maophyuhpa ta miah paysa vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eima chiehlei nona khata, Krista cha moleipazy vyuhpa ta a daihtita liata thi ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chyhsa siapa châta thi awpa cha chyhsa ta khoh kaw hlei aw vei; chyhsa phapa châta deikua cha, a thi ngâhpa ama y ngyu ma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Châhrasala Khazohpa ta a kyhpachâna cha keimo châta vaw paluahsa ta, moleipazy eima châ nota, Krista cha eima châta thi ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chavâta tahmâ a thisaih ta thai pachâsapa eima châ tawhta chhochhi cha, ano vâta Khazohpa hiehâhna tawhta pachhapa ta eima y via pachai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khakhaipa eima châ nota hmahta, a Sawchapawpa thina vâta Khazohpa nata a ryhpa ta eima y khiahta cha, tahmâ eimâ ryh ha tawh chhochhi cha, a hrona vâta pachhapa ta eima y via pachai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha dei châ vei, tahmâ aryhna miah a pahmôsatuhpa eima Beipa Zisu Krista vâta Khazohpa liata eimâ ly.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chyhsa pakha vâta moleina khizaw liata a ngia ta, moleina vâta thina a ngia ta, cha hawhna chata, chyhsa zydua ta hmo ama paraopa vâta, thina ta chyhsa zydua cha a chahryh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ryhpa y hlâta khizaw liata moleina y ha ta, ryhpa a y vei khiahta cha, moleina cha moleina ta pachâpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Châhrasala Âdâh daihti tawhta Mawsi daihti taihta, Âdâh paraona hawhta hmo a parao leipazy chô liata chhao, thina chata ryu a reih lymâ. Âdâh cha a vy awpa pakhona a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Châhrasala hmosaipiepa cha moleina nata a lyu vei. Chyhsa pakha moleina vâta hmahta chyhsa hluhpi ama thi khiahta cha, Khazohpa ngiachhiena nata chyhsa pakha, Zisu Krista ngiachhiena hmosaipiepa chhochhi cha, chyhsa hluhpi chô liata vaoheipa ta a y tlai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmosaipiepa cha chyhsa pakha moleina vâta hmo a vaw ypa nata a lyu vei. Thailei pachâsana pachiana cha chyhsa pakha vâta vaw y ta, thai pachâsana hmosaipiepa deikua cha, moleina hluhpi vâta tlao a vaw ypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chyhsa pakha moleina vâta, cha chyhsa pakha vâta hmahta thina ta ryu a reih khiahta cha, chyhsa pakha, Zisu Krista vâta ngiachhiena hluh ngaitapa nata siana hmosaipiepa a daotuhpazy chhochhi ta cha, hrona liata ryu ama reih tlai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moleina miakha vâta chyhsa zydua thailei pachâsapa ama châpa hawhta, siana hmotaopa miakha vâta chyhsa zydua thai pachâsapa châ ei ta, hrona ama hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chyhsa pakha reingiah leina vâta chyhsa hluhpi moleipa ama châ hapa hawhta, chyhsa pakha reingiahna vâta chyhsa hluhpi mosiapa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moleina pôh nawpa ta ryhpa vaw y ta, châhrasala moleina a pôhna lia maihta ngiachhiena a pôh via rili.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moleina chata thina ta ryureih ta, ngiachhiena deikua cha, eima Beipa Zisu Krista zawhzi ta chhâzaw hrona a tlôkheipa siana ryureina a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khâpa eima reih khao aw? Ngiachhiena a pôh thei nawpa ta, moleina eima tao pazao aw ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Châ bao va! Keimo moleina a thisai hapazy pi ta cha, kheihta ma moleina liata eima y thei khao aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimo Krista Zisu liata bâti a châ hapazy pi cha, a thina liata bâti eima châ ha tahpa pahno veih ei chi ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thina liata bâti châpa ta, a hnohta pabupa ta y pi ta, Krista cha Paw rônahna ta athihpa hry tawhta a pathyupa hawhna khata, keimo chhao hrona thiehpa ta eima charei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thina liata thi hrapa ta, ano nata eimâ zao ha khiahta cha, a thyuheihna liata chhao thyu hrapa ta, ano nata eimâ zao tlai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moleina a phaohpa pôhpa he pahleipadiapa ta, moleina sei ta eima y khao lei nawpa ta, eima chyhsa parohpa cha a hnohta khaipâpa ta a y haw tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thi hapa cha moleina tawhta a pua haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Krista hnohta eima thi ha khiahta cha, a hnohta eima hroh aw tahpa eimâ ngiapâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Krista, athihpa hry tawhta pathyupa cha, thi khao aw vei tahpa eima pahno. Thina ta a chô liata bie hnei khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thina cha moleina lâ kyh liata chhâzaw châta ei kha thi ta, a hrona deikua cha, Khazohpa lâ kyh liata a hroh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata nâmo chhao, moleina lâ kyh liata a thi hapa ta a rao u la, Khazohpa lâ kyh liata deikua cha, Krista Zisu liata a hrohpa ta a rao teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nama sapa khona pipatlohsa awpa ta, nama pôhpa thi theipa chô liata moleina ta ryureih khah sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nama pôhpa pachiahpazy cha, sialeina chhaichhi châta moleina lâta hlâ leipa u la, thina tawhta hrona lâ chhihthapazy nama châpa hawhta, Khazohpa lâta a hlâ u la, nama pôhpa pachiahpazy cha siana chhaichhi châta Khazohpa lâta hlâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ryhpa ry liata y khao leipa ei chi ta, ngiachhiena ry liata nama y hapa vâta, moleina ta nama chô liata biehnei khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kheihta ma a châ aw? Ryhpa ry liata y leipa pi ta, ngiachhiena ry liata eima ypa vâta, moleina tao awpa a châ ma? Châ bao va!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahy lia rai ta ama bie zyh awpa ta sei ta namâ ngia khiahta cha, a bie nama zyhpa sei nama châ tahpa pahno veih ei chi ma? Moleina sei ta namâ ngia khiahta cha, thina lâ châ chhi aw ei ta, reingiahna sei ta namâ ngia khiahta cha, siana lâ a châ chhi aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Châhrasala Khazohpa cha reithaipa ta y mawh sy! Nâmo, eikhano ta moleina sei a châ tyhpazy chi kha, ama pachunazy palôh hmeiseihpa ta a zyhtuhpazy nama vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moleina tawhta pua ei chi ta, siana seizy nama vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nama sapa chiehleina pahnopa ta, chyhsapa pachâna lâ tawhta ei reipa a châ. Nama pôhpa pachiahpazy cha, pathaih leina sei ta vaw hlâ tyh ei chi ta, moleina papôh rilina sei ta nama hlâ tyhpa hawhna khata, tahmâ la nama pôhpa pachiahpazy cha pathaihna lâ a chhipa siana seizy châ awpa ta hlâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moleina seizy nama châ nota la, siana ta nama chô liata biehnei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tahmâ ta nama zakhei kawpa hmo nama vaw tao tyhpazy tawhna khata, khâpa theilâpa ma nama hmô? Kha hmozy chhâna cha thina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua cha, moleina tawhta khotalaipa châ ha ei chi ta, Khazohpa seizy nama châ haw. A theilâpa nama hmôpa cha pathaihna lâta a chhipa châ ta, cha chhâna cha chhâzaw hrona a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moleina hlao cha thina châ tlôh ta, Khazohpa hmosaipiepa deikua cha, eima Beipa Krista Zisu zawhzi ta chhâzaw hrona a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, ryhpa cha chyhsapa hro chhôh deita ta a chô liata ryu a reih tyh tahpa pahno veih ei chi mâ? Cha cha ryhpa a pahnopazy hnohta ei reih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vahpa a hneipa chanô châta, a vahpa hro chhôh cha, ryhpa ta a vahpa liata a chahry. A vahpa a thi tawh deikua cha, ahneina ryhpa tawhta a pua haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A vahpa hro chhôh ta mohropa a hnei khiahta cha, apheinô ama tah aw. A vahpa a thi ha khiah deikua cha, ahneina ryhpa tawhta pua ha ta, chapaw hropa a hneipa chhao ta, apheinô châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, unawh saih u, nâmo chhao, ryhpa cha Krista pôhpa liata nama thisai haw. Chatanachata mohropa, athihpa hry tawhta pathyupa Krista eih châ ha ei chi ta, Khazohpa châta thei pha eima pathei thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sapa ta eima y no kha, ryhpa ta molei khonazy papua tyh ta, eima pôhpa pachiahpazy liata thina thei pathei awpa ta rai a hria tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua cha, miah a chahrypa cha thisaipa ta, ryhpa tawhta eima pua haw. Chatanachata châropa parohpa siezie hawhta châ khao leipa ta, Thlahpa hro thiehpa ta eima chakao thei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khâpa eima reih khao aw? Ryhpa cha moleina ma? Châ bao va! Ryhpa y leipa sala, moleina ei pahno lei awpa tlai. Ryhpa ta, “Na uahva awpa châ vei,” tah leipa sala, uahvana cha khâpa ma a châ tahpa pahno aw va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Châhrasala moleina ta biepiepa cha rypaohna ta hmâpa ta, uahvana to kei liata a paysa tyh. Ryhpa y leipa sala, moleina cha a thipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eikhano kha ryhpa hnei leipa ta hroh na ta, châhrasala biepiepa a vaw y nahta, moleina a vaw hra ta, kei cha ei thi haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hro nawpa ta biepiepa cha, thi nawpa tlao a châ tahpa ei vaw pahno haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moleina ta biepiepa cha ryhpaohna ta hmâpa ta, na dôvei ta, biepiepa hmâpa ta eina thie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta ryhpa cha pathaih ta, biepiepa chhao pathaih ta, sia ta, a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, hmo phapa cha kei châta thina a châ ma? Châ bao va! Hmo phapa cha moleina ta hmâh ta, keima liata thina a tlôkheipa tlao a châ. Chatanachata moleina cha moleina a châ tahpa a lâ aw ta, molei ngaitapa a châzie biepiepa ta a palâsa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ryhpa cha thlahpa hmo a châ tahpa eima pahno. Kei deikua cha sapa chyhsa, moleina sei ta zua hapa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmo ei taopa he a pachâna pahno va na. Ei tao khopa tao leipa na ta, ei haopa hmo tlao ei tao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ei khoh leipa ei tao tlôh khiahta cha, ryhpa cha pha ei tahkheipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatanachata ei hmotaopazy cha keima taopa châ leipa ta, keima liata a ypa moleina ta a tao tyhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ei sapa liata hmo phapa rai y vei tahpa ei pahno. Hmo pha tao khona keima liata y ta, châhrasala tao theina hnei va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ei tao khohpa hmo phapa tao leipa na ta, ei tao khoh leipa hmo chhiepa ei tao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ei tao khoh leipa ei tao tlôh khiahta cha, a taotuhpa cha kei châ leipa na ta, keima liata a ypa moleina ta a taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chatanachata he ryhpa he ei vaw pahno haw: Hmo phapa tao ei khoh nahta, moleina ta einâ vaw hnia ha tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ei palôh ta Khazohpa ryhpa liata a ly na ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ei pôhpa pachiahpazy liata deikua cha, ryhpa nanopa a y tahpa ei pahno. Cha chata ei palôh ryhpa cha a dyuh ta, ei pôhpa pachiahpazy liata moleina ryhpa a ypa lâna chata sei ta einâ chhi tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chyhsa ngiachhiechhihpa ei châ kaw dia! He thina pôhpa tawhna heta ahy nâ pachha aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zisu Krista eima Beipa vâta Khazohpa cha reithaipa ta y mawh sy! Kei tlai chhao cha, ei palôh ta Khazohpa ryhpa chakao ta, ei sapa ta deikua cha, moleina ryhpa ei vaw chakao ha tyh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta tahmâ la Krista Zisu liata a ypa, sapa ta hroh leipa ta, Thlahpa ta a hrohpazy châta cha thailei pachâsana rai y khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Krista Zisu liata hrona Thlahpa ryhpa chata moleina nata thina ryhpa tawhta a cha papua ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sapa chiehleina vâta ryhpa ta a tao thei leipa cha, Khazohpa ta a tao haw. Ano Sawchapawpa tlai cha, molei theipa sapa pôhpa paphaosapa ta, molei atheihna châta vaw tuah ta, sapa liata moleina a ypa cha thailei a pachâsa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatanachata keimo, sapa ta hroh khao leipa ta, Thlahpa ta a hroh hapazy liana heta, ryhpa ta â hnawpa siana cha pakipa ta a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sapa ta a hrohpazy cha, sapa hmozy liata ama pachâna soh ei ta, Thlahpa ta a hrohpazy deikua cha, Thlahpa hmozy liata ama pachâna ama soh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sapa hmo pachâna cha thina châ ta, Thlahpa hmo pachâna deikua cha, hrona nata thlalôhna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sapa hmo pachâna cha, Khazohpa ryhpa ry liata a y leipa vâta, Khazohpa a dyuhpa a châ. Hmeiseihta ta, sapa hmo a pachâpa châta cha, Khazohpa ryhpa ry liata y hmeiseih thei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sapa ta a hrohpazy cha Khazohpa palysa thei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Châhrasala Khazohpa Thlahpa nâmo liata a y khiahta cha, sapa ta a ypa châ leipa ei chi ta, Thlahpa ta a ypa tlao nama châ. Ahy rai Krista Thlahpa a hnei leipa cha ano chyhsa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Châhrasala Krista cha nâmo liata a y khiahta cha, moleina vâta nama pôhpa cha thi hra sala, nama thlahpa deikua cha siana vâta a hroh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Athihpa hry tawhta Zisu a pathyutuhpa Thlahpa nâmo liata a y khiahta cha, athihpa hry tawhta Krista Zisu a pathyutuhpa chata, nâmo liata a ypa a Thlahpa zawhzi ta, nama pôhpa thi theipazy cha a pahro aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta unawh saih u, a bâhpa eima hnei. Sapa liata leibâh deikua châ vei, sapa khozie hawhta hrona liata leibâh châ hra vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sapa khozie hawhta nama hroh khiahta cha, thi aw ei chi ta, nama pôhpa hmotaopazy Thlahpa ta nama thie lymâ khiahta deikua cha, nama hroh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khazohpa Thlahpa chhihthapa ta a ypa maih Khazohpa sawzy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chipa ta y heih awpa ta seichâna thlahpa nama topa châ leipa ta, saw châna Thlahpa tlao to ei chi ta, cha Thlahpa vâna chata “Âbâ! Ei paw!” tahpa ta eima aw theipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cha Thlahpa tlai chata keimo thlahpa nata a kaopa ta, Khazohpa sawzy eima châ tahpa miah a pahnokhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawzy eima châ khiahta cha, ryutotuhpazy eima châ. Khazohpa ryu totuhpazy châ pi ta, Krista ryutolâhpazy eima châ. A hnohta riethei eima tao khiahta cha, a hnohta palyupalihpa ta eima y hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tahmâ nota pasa taonazy he, noh hro ta eima chô liata rônahna palâsa awpa nata pakho khi ta rao va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmotaopazy ta Khazohpa sawzy aluahna daihti vâpa ta, ngiatiah leipa ta ama hâ thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmotaopazy cha hraoleipa ta y awpa ta raopa châ ha ta, âmo khopa vâta châ leipa ta, a paysatuhpa vâta tlao a châ. Châhrasala hnabeiseihna a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmotaopazy tlai chhao cha thu theina sei tawhta papuapa châ aw ei ta, Khazohpa sawzy khotalaina rônahpa liata amâ ngia hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmotaopa zydua cha sawzeih pasa taopa ta, tahmâ taihta amâ rôh ngâ thlâh ha tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmotaopazy dei châ vei, keimo, Thlahpa thei hmiatuapa a hneituhpazy tlai chhao heta, saw châ awpa ta eima pôhpa chatlaina cha ngiatiah leipa ta hâpa ta, palôh ta eimâ rôh ngâ kaw hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cha hnabeiseihna vâna chata pachhapa eima châ. Hmô theipa hnabeiseihpa cha, hnabeiseihna châ vei. Hmô hapa cha, ahy ma hnabeiseihpa ta a hâ khao aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eima hmô leipa eima hnabei a seih khiahta deikua cha, palôh pasi kawpa ta eima hâ lylia tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, Thlahpa ta eima chiehleinazy liata miah a bao tyh. Thlahchhâ nawpa chybia chhao eima pahno lei nota, Thlahpa ta ahrôna rei hlei thei leipa ta thlah miah a chhâpa tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thlahpa cha Khazohpa khozie hawhta mopathaihpazy châta thlah a chhâ tyhpa a châpa vâta, palôh mohtuhpa Khazohpa ta Thlahpa pachâna cha a pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khazohpa kyh a pachâtuhpa, ano achhuahna hawhta a awpazy châta, Khazohpa ta ato liata ama pha nawpa ta a hriapa tyh ei tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A pahno chhieliepazy cha, a Sawchapawpa hawhta y awpa ta a rao chhielie ei. Chatanachata a Sawchapawpa cha unawh hluhpi hry liata sawchapaw uhtheipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A rao chhieliepazy cha aw ta, a awpazy thai pachâsa ta, thai a pachâsapazy cha a palyupalih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cha kyhzy liana chata khâpa eima reih khao aw? Khazohpa eima chhâh â châ khiahta cha, ahy miah a dyuh thei aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A Sawchapawpa tlai chhao pahlôh leipa ta, eima zydua châta a pietuhpa chata, ato a saipa ta miah pie hra aw vei mâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khazohpa a tlyhpazy cha ahy a leih aw? Thai pachâsatuhpa cha Khazohpa châ tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahy ma thailei a pachâsa aw? A thipa cha Krista Zisu châ tlôh ta. Cha dei châ vei, ano cha pathyupa ta y ta, Khazohpa chachâh lâta ypa ta, miah reikheituhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Krista kyhpachâna tawhta ahy miah pachhaih thei aw? Rietheina ta tlyma, pachârôhna ta tlyma, taolana ta tlyma, chakâhna ta tlyma, thluahruana ta tlyma, chichhihna ta tlyma, zaozi ta tlyma miah a pachhaih aw ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nâma vâta noh y ta thiepa ta y pi ta, Mietaku thie awpazy hawhta pachâpa eima châ,” tahpa ta ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pachhaih bao va! Cha zydua liana chata kyh miah pachâtuhpa vâta, pahnietuhpazy hlâta rônah viapa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thina nata hrona tlyma, vâlyuhchâpazy nata ahripazy tlyma, hmo y haipa nata a vaw y awpazy tlyma, hmotaotheina tlyma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />asâhna nata athuna tlyma, hmotaopa zydua liata hmo hropa khâpa ta hmah eima Beipa Krista Zisu liata a ypa Khazohpa kyhpachâna tawhta miah pachhaih thei aw vei tahpa a sia ngaitapa ta ei pahno.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Krista liata biehmeiseihpa ei reih, haih va na. Ei chhie nata pha pahnona ta Thlahpa Pathaihpa liata eina pahnokhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ei palôh liata rietheina ru ngaitapa nata pachârôhna lei thei leipa ei vao thlâh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ei unawhzy, sapa lâta ei chiheihzy châna heta, kei he chhiesapa ta ypa ta, Krista tawhta chhawh pathlahpa ta y aw sah la ei tah tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izarei chyhsa châ ei ta, saw châna, rônahna, biehrai, ryhpa piena, achhyna nata bietai zy âmo eih a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathlatuhzy kha ama mapawzy châ ei ta, sapa kyh lâta cha Krista tlai chhao cha, âmo chi tawhta a vaw puapa a châ. Ano cha ato zydua chô liata Khazohpa châ ta, chhâzaw ta reithaipa ta y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Châhrasala Khazohpa bie cha hraoleipa ta a y tahna châ vei. Izarei pathla zydua Izarei châ khai hlei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abarahâ pathlazy ama châpa vâta, ama zydua ta a sawzy châ khai hra veih ei. “Aisika liana heta na pathlazy a laichadaipa a châ aw,” tahpa tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha yzie cha, sapa sawzy cha Khazohpa sawzy châ leipa ei ta, bietai sawzy cha Abarahâ pathla ta raopa tlao ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tahmâ daihti hawhpa liana heta vaw tlô heih aw na ta, Sârâ ta sawchapaw a sa aw,” tahpa ta bietai piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha dei châ vei, Rebekâ chhao kha chyhsa pakha liata, miah pathlatuhpa Aisika liata maphieh a phao no kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hawsaihzy ama pi hlâta, hmo phapa tlyma, hmo chhiepa tlyma ama tao hlâta, hmotaopa vâta châ leipa ta, atlyhna kyh liata Khazohpa hmochhuahpa cha a sie pazao lymâ thei nawpa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a hnohta, “Uhthei viapa ta seihnai viapa a chakao aw,” tahpa ta chhopa a châpa kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Zakaw kyh pachâ na ta, Esaw deikua ei hao,” tahpa ropa a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha khiahta cha, khâpa eima reih khao aw? Khazohpa liata sialeina a y ma? Y bao va!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khazohpa ta Mawsi hnohta, “Ei ngiachhie awpa chyhsa cha ngiachhie aw na ta, zawh ei ngiah awpa chyhsa cha zawh ei ngiah aw,” tahpa ta a vaw reih ha khawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chavâta chyhsapa khotlyna vâta châ leipa ta, hriapasana vâta châ hra vei, a ngiachhietuhpa Khazohpa vâta tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta Biehrai ta Phiraoh hnohta, “He hmo châta ei cha padua, ei hmotaotheina nâma liata paluahsa ta, khizaw zydua liata ei moh pathâhsapa ta a y thei nawpa ta,” a tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatanachata Khazohpa ta a khopa maih ngiachhie tyh ta, a khopa maih chhorupa ta a tao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nâ ta ei hnohta, “Khazohpa ta khazia miah a maochhie thlâh ha chy? Ahy ma a khopa a dyuh thei?” na tah ualua aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Châhrasala chyhsapa y, Khazohpa a chakhia hrapa chi cha, ahy ma na châ? Hmotaopa ta a taotuhpa hnohta, “Khazia he hawhta eina tao chi?” a tah aw mâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Beihlei tlo kha tawhta, zachhihpa ta hmâ awpa beih sôh viapa nata hmâ chakhyh awpa beih sôh lei viapa zy tao awpa ta, beihvituhpa cha beihlei chô liata bie hnei vei mâ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khazohpa ta a hiehâhna palâsa ta, a hmotaotheina pahnosa awpa khoh hra sala, hiehâhna beih a leidia tlâhpazy chô liata palôh pasi ngaitapa ta a dao lylia khiahta cha, khâpa a pei aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngiachhiena beihzy chô liata a rônahna palâsa nawpa ta, cha hmo cha Khazohpa ta a rônahna châta â chhuanoh chhielie hapa châ sala, khâpa a pei aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cha ngiachhiena beihzy cha, keimo, Zuzy hry tawhta a awpazy dei châ leipa pi ta, Zenitaizy hry tawhta a awpazy chhao eima châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khazohpa ta Hôsia châbu liata hetana heta a reipa kha: “Ei phopi a châ beih leipa cha, ‘Ei phopi,’ tah aw na ta; Kyhpachâ beih leipa cha, ‘Kyhpachâpa,’ ei tah aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“‘Ei phopi châ veih ei chi,’ a tahna su liata, ‘Khazohpa hroh sawzy,’ bipa ama châ aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isai chhao ta Izarei kyh liata, “Izarei sawzy cha tilaipi sadi zie ta hluh hra ei sala, laibâhpa deita pachhapa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abeipa ta hawh leipa ta a lei he tlokhuh a hrie aw,” a tahpa kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isai pyly ta, “Pheisaihzy Abeipa ta Chi pathla miah pahlôhpa vei mawh sala, Sawdawmâ hawhna khata châ aw pi ta, Kawmawrâ hawhna khata eima y aw,” tahpa ta a vaw rei chhielie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khâpa eima reih khao aw? Siana a chadai leipa Zenitaizy ta ngiapâna ta siana tlao to ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />siana ryhpa a chadaituhpa Izarei ta siana to thei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khâpa vâta maw? Ngiapâna ta a chadai leipa ei ta, hmotaopa ta to thei awpa hawhta amâ chadaipa vâta a châ. Achapiana lô liata amâ chapia haw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Pachâ teh, Zaio liata achapiana lô soh na ta, Moleina lôpanô ei soh; Ahy rai ano a ngiapâpa cha, Maophyuh aw vei,” tahpa ta ropa hawhta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, Izarei sawzy pachha ama châ awpa cha, ei palôh khopa nata âmo châta Khazohpa lâta ei thlahchhâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khazohpa châta phahnai amâ ngiah tahpa ei pahnokhei ei. Châhrasala pahno pasia leipa ta phahnai a ngiahpa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khazohpa siana pahno leipa ta, âmo siana a duakhei a chhuah ei ta, Khazohpa siana liata a ngiarih veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Krista cha ngiapâtuhpa zydua ta siana ama hmô thei nawpa ta ryhpa chhâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ryhpa zyhpa vâta siana hmôna kyh liata, Mawsi ta, “Ryhpa a zyhtuhpa cha, ryhpa vâna chata a hroh aw,” tahpa ta roh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngiapâna vâta siana deikua ta cha, “Na palôh ta, ‘Vârâh tawhta Krista a zâ chhi awpa ta, ahy ma vârâh lâ a kiah aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Athihpa hry tawhta Krista a kaw chhi awpa ta, ahy ma athihkhih lâ a zu aw?’ tah khah sy,” tlao a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha bie chata khâpa ma a reih? “Bie ta a châ hnia, na pakah nata na palôh liata a y,” tah ta, cha bie cha ngiapâna bie eima chhopa he a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na pakah ta, “Zisu cha Abeipa a châ” tahpa ta a châhkhei la, athihpa hry tawhta Khazohpa ta a pathyu tahpa na palôh ta nâ ngiapâ khiahta cha, pachhapa ta na y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Palôh ta a ngiapâpa cha thai pachâsapa ta y ta, pakah ta a châhkheipa cha pachhapa ta a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biehrai ta, “Ahy rai ano a ngiapâpa maih maophyuh aw veih ei,” a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zu nata Krikâh likah ananona y vei. Abeipa pakha cha ama zydua chô liata Abeipa châ ta, ano a padotuhpa zydua chô liata byhnâ thata a pie tyhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ahy rai Abeipa moh a padopa maih pachhapa ama châ aw,” tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, amâ ngiapâ leipa cha kheihta ama pado thei aw? Ama thei beih leipa cha kheihta amâ ngiapâ thei aw? Biechhotuhpa y leipa ta kheihta ama thei thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuapa ama châ vei khiahta cha, kheihta bie ama chho thei aw? “Thatihpha a vaw tlôkheituhpazy phei cha â ngia kaw dia!” tahpa ta ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isai ta, “Abeipa, eima bie reipa ahy ma a ngiapâ?” a tahpa hawhta, thâtihpha cha ama zydua ta zyh khai veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngiapâna cha theina vâta vaw y ta, theina cha Krista bie vâta a vaw y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, thei ha veih ei ma? tahpa ta hiahrina tao aw sah la, thei cha ama thei haw. “Ama pyu râh to liata pathâh ta, Ama bie kaokih taihta a pathâh,” tahpa ta ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Izarei ta pahno vei ma? tahpa ta hiahri heih aw sah la, he kyh liata Mawsi ta, “Phopi ta rei tlâh leipazy hmâpa ta, Nama hia cha patliasa aw ei na ta; Phopi hrupa hmâpa ta, Nama hie ei cha pahâh aw ei,” tahpa ta vaw reih tuachai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isai chhao ta riahpha ngaitapa ta, “Nâ tlua leipazy ta na hmô ei ta, Nâ pado leipazy ei pahnosa ei,” tahpa ta a vaw reih haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izarei kyh lia chhao ta Isai ta, “Noh y ta, Reingiah leipa phopi lâta ei ku pazawh na ta, Chhorupa phopi lâta ei bâh ei pazawh,” tahpa ta a vaw reih haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, hiahrina ei tao. Khazohpa ta ano phopi cha a thy aw ma? Thy bao va! Kei chhao he Izarei chyhsa, Abarahâ pathla, Benzami chi ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khazohpa ta a pahno hapa a phopi cha thy aw vei. Biehrai ta Elaizâh kyh a reipa kha pahno veih ei chi ma? Elaizâh ta Izarei kyh Khazohpa lâ tlôkhei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Abeipa, na hrohsopazy thie ei ta, na maisâhzy pacho ei ta, kei deita y na ta, kei chhao thie einâ chhuah ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khazohpa ta kheihta â chhy? “Bâlâ hmiakô liata pakhu paneih beih leipa chyhsa sâh sari kei châta ei pahlôh thlâh haw,” tahpa ta â chhy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, tahmâ chhao laibâhpazy ama y. Âmo cha ngiachhiena ta â tlyhpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngiachhiena vâta a châ khiahta cha, hmotaopa vâta châ khao vei. Cha hawhta a châ vei khiahta cha, ngiachhiena cha ngiachhiena châ khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, kheihta a châ aw? Izarei ta a tluapa cha hmô leipa ta, atlyhpazy ta hmô ei ta, ahropazy cha kuhchhâpa ta ama y,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Khazohpa ta âmo cha, Tanoh taihta hruna thlahpa pie ta, A hmô thei leipa mo piepa ta, A thei thei leipa nah a pie ei,” tahpa ropa hawhna khata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dâvi chhao ta, “Ama tlâhkhai cha, Ama châta khoheih nata aphyh châ sala, Achapiana nata viarithôna châ mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama hmô thei lei nawpa ta, Ama mozy zoh sala, Ama zôh chhâzaw ta a ko mawh sy,” tahpa ta a vaw reih ha hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, amâ chapiana cha ama pao pathlah nawpa a châ ma? Châ bao va! Izarei hia patliasa awpa ta, amâ chapiana vâta Zenitaizy lâ pachhana a vaw tlôpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama paona hmahta khizaw hneirôna châ sala, ama leina Zenitaizy hneirôna a châ khiahta cha, ama pakina chhochhi cha hneirôna a châ pachai aw dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tahmâ nâmo, Zenitaizy hnohta ei reih. Zenitaizy lyuhchâpa ei châpa he, rônah ei tah ngaita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatanachata ei chiheih Zu chyhsazy hia patliasapa ta, khazie chhâ ma pachha thei aw veih ei na ma ei tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Âmo dythana hmahta khizaw aryhna a châ khiahta cha, âmo apyhna chhochhi cha, thina tawhta hrona leipa ta cha, khâpa a châ aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thei hmiatuapa châta viahchhâ eichheihpa hlâpa a pathaih khiahta cha, viahchhâ tlâ pôhpalôhpa a pathaih. A thari a pathaih khiahta cha, a chiahzy a pathaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Châhrasala a chiah thokhazy cha thliepa châ ta, nâ, râh liata ôli tho tlai chi cha, ôli tho phapazy liata pazaopa ta, ôli tho phapa thari nâ hly khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a chiahzy chô liata a palai khah y. Nâ vaw palai thlu ha khiah ei ta cha, he he a thei mah y. Thari cha nâ ta chyh leipa chi ta, thari ta nâma tlao a cha chyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pazaopa ta ei y thei nawpa ta vei ma, a chiahzy cha thliepa a châ vei,” na tah thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Â do. Âmo cha ngiapâleina vâta thliepa châ ei ta, nâ deikua cha ngiapâna vâta a duahpa na châ. Chavâta a palai leipa la, tlao chi mah y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pikheipa chiahzy hmahta Khazohpa ta a pahlôh vei khiahta cha, nâ, pazaopa chiah chhochhi cha, cha pahlôh tiarâh aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa phazie nata chichhihzie he pachâ mah y. A paopazy châta chichhihpa châ ta, nâma châta deikua cha, a phana liata na y thlâh ha khiahta cha, Khazoh phapa a châ. Chataleipatala nâ chhao chhawh pathlahpa na châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Âmo chhao cha ngiapâleipa ta ama y ngâ thlâh vei khiahta cha, pazaopa ta ama y aw. Khazohpa cha âmo pazao heih theina hmotaotheina a hneipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nâ, râh liata ôli kô tawhta chhawhpa hmahta, pikhei siezie tyhpa chakhiapa ta, sadô liata lopa ôli tho liata pazaopa na châ thei khiahta cha, pikheipa ta ôli chiah a châpazy chhochhi cha, âmo ôli tho liata pazao via pachaipa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unawh saih u, he bienyupa he nama pahno lei awpa khoh va na. Chataleipatala namâ palai pathlei aw na. Zenitaizy pakina a vaw tlô hlâta, Izarei chô liata kuhchhana a rakhapa ta a vaw tlô chypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Izarei zydua pachhapa ama châ aw, “Zaio tawhta pachhatuhpa vaw pua aw ta, Zakaw tawhta moleina a pahlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama moleinazy ei pahlei khai tita, Cha cha ama hnohta ei biehrai awpa a châ,” tahpa ropa hawhta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thâtihpha kyh liata la, nâmo vâta khakhaipa châ ei ta, atlyhna kyh liata deikua cha, pathlatuhpazy vâta kyhpachâpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khazohpa hmosaipiepazy nata a awna cha panano heih theipa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eikhano ta cha Khazohpa rei a ngiah leipa châ ei chi ta, tahmâ deikua cha, âmo reingiah leina zawhzi ta ngiachhiena nama to haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, âmo chhao tahmâ reingiah leipa ta y chy hra ei sala, nâmo chô liata ngiachhiena palâsapa vâna heta, âmo chhao ngiachhiena ama to thei hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ngiachhie khai thei nawpa ei ta, Khazohpa ta chyhsa zydua reingiah leina liata a khô khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hy â thu kaw dia, Khazohpa hneirôna, Sona nata pahnona zy cha! A ryureinazy pahno thei awpa châ leipa ta, A lâpizy chathô thei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abeipa palôh ahy a pahno? Ahy ma ano ryhraotuhpa ta a y?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thô awpa hnabeiseihpa ta, Ahy ma Khazohpa lâ hmo a pie?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ano tawhta, Ano vâta, Ano châta, Hmo to a ypa a châ. A hnohta chhâzaw ta rônahna y mawh sy! Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta unawh saih u, Khazohpa ngiachhiena vâta, atheihna hrohpa nata pathaihpa nata a pyh tlâh châ awpa ta, nama pôhpa cha Khazohpa lâ hlâ awpa ta ei châ haw ei. Cha cha thlahpa ta Khazohpa namâ chhynazie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />He khizaw ryhpa hawhna heta y leipa u la, nama palôh pathiehpa ta tlao anano lymâ teh u. Chatanachata Khazohpa khopa cha khâpa ma a châ tahpa pahno thei aw ei chi ta, hmo phapa a pyh tlâhpa nata phapakipa cha nama pahno thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama hry liata chyhsa ahy hmahta a châna dopa hlâta a sâh viapa ta a pachâ leipa sala, Khazohpa ta chyhsa to hnohta ngiapâna a piepa rakhapa lymâ hawhta, a châna dopa a pahno thai awpa ta, Khazohpa ta ngiachhiena eina piepa zawhzi ta ei cha chho ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pôhpa miakha liata pachiahpa hluhpi hnei pi ta, pachiahpa zydua hmotaopa deikua a lyu vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata keimo chhao, a hluhpi châ hra sih la, Krista liata pôhpa miakha châ pi ta, eima zydua ta a zao khaipa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngiachhiena piepa eima châpa lymâ hawhta, hmopiepa nanopa eima hnei chyu. Hrohsona bie rei awpa a châ khiahta cha, eimâ ngiapâna rakha lymâ hawhta reih sih la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chakao awpa a châ khiahta cha chakao sih la, pachutuhpa ta pachu sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />pasyutuhpa ta pasyuna bie reih sala, hmopietuhpa ta riapha ngaitapa ta pie sala, ryureituhpa ta tiamapa ta ryureih sala, ngiachhiena rai hriatuhpa ta a ly ngaitapa ta hria mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kyhpachâna cha haiphiana a hlao leipa châ mawh sy. Moleina a hao u la, hmo phapa khâchâ patu muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unawh kyhpachâna ta kyh a pachâ raihrie u la, a palyupalih raihrie muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Phahnai angiahna kyh liata daopathla leipa u la, palôh thathyu ngaitapa ta Abeipa chakao muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnabeiseihna liata a ly u la, rietheitaona liata tiama u la, thlahchhâ lylia muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mopathaihpa a phahlapazy deichhy u la, khichhai pasô muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Châ taolatuhpazy byhnâ awpa u la, chhiesapa leipa ta, byhnâ awpa teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Alypazy a lykhei u la, achapazy chakhei teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A dyh raihrie u la, a pasâhsa leipa ta, chyhsa nawhpazy a kao u la, apasosa khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahy moleina rai moleina ta viarithô leipa u la, chyhsa zydua mohmô ta hmo dopa tao awpa ta pachâna tlao hmâh tyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tao theipa a châ khiahta la, nâmo lâ tawh chhâ ta chyhsa zydua nata a ryhpa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kho ngaitapa saih u, nama phuh a la leipa u la, Khazohpa pathiiana tlei hri teh u. “Phuh cha keima la awpa châ ta, kei ta viari ei thô aw, Abeipa ta a tah,” tahpa ta ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chavâta, “Na chariahpa a nodi khiahta cha, nie awpa pie la, a dâhphi khiahta cha, do awpa pie mah y. Cha hawhta na tao khiahta cha, a luh chô liata meiia beih na khaihpa a châ aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moleina a patiahsa leipa la, phana ta moleina cha tlao tiah mah y.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chyhsa to ta ama chô liata ryureituhpazy bie ama zyh awpa a châ. Khazohpa rao leipa ryureituhpa y veih ei. Ryureituhpazy cha Khazohpa raopa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chavâta ryureituhpa a dyuhpa cha Khazohpa raopa a dyuhpa châ ta, a dyuhtuhpazy cha thailei pachâpa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ryureituhpazy cha hmo phapa a taotuhpazy châta chichhihpa châ leipa ei ta, hmo chhiepa a taotuhpazy châta deikua cha, chichhihpa ama châ. Ryureituhpa chi leipa ta y na khoh ma? Hmo pha tao la a cha reithai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ano cha na pha nawpa ta Khazohpa chakaotuhpa a châ. Hmo moleipa na tao khiah deikua cha, chi kaw mah y, zaozi cha a chaba thlâhthli vei. Ano cha Khazohpa chakaotuhpa châ ta, hmo paraotuhpa chô liata Khazohpa hiehâhna phuhlatuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa hiehâhna chipa vâ dei châ leipa ta, chhie nata pha pahnona vâta, ryureituhpa bie na zyh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ryureituhpazy cha Khazohpa chakaotuhpazy châ ei ta, Khazohpa chakaona rai a hriapazy ama châpa vâta, chhiezy chhao nama pie tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chyhsa zydua lâta pie awpa maih pie lymâ teh u. Chhie pie awpa lâta chhie pie u la, leimâ chei awpa lâta leimâ cheih u la, za awpa cha za u la, palyupalih awpa cha palyupalih teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kyh a pachâ raihriena dei leipa ta cha, ahy hmah khâpa hmah a bâh khuh vy. A chyhsa heih kyh pachâtuhpa cha ryhpa a pakipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nâ phei awpa châ vei; Liany na cheih awpa châ vei; Na paru awpa châ vei; Na uahva awpa châ vei,” tahpa biepiepazy nata biepiepa hropazy chhao, “Nâma kyh nâ pachâpa hawhta na vaih kyh na pachâ awpa a châ,” tahpa heta a syhpahmaoh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kyhpachâna ta vaih pasasa beih vei. Chavâta kyhpachâna cha ryhpa zyh pakina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tahmâhlâ hmo yzie pahno ei chi ta, amôpa thyu â daih haw tahpa nama pahnopa vâta cha cha ei reih. Tahmâ cha eimâ ngiapâ tua no hlâta eima pachhana a hnia via ha tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zâ he chhâ daihmâ ta, khih a deih daihmâ. Chavâta zohna hmotaopa zydua thy sih la, khaihna chhaichhi ta a tobi suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nohchhô ta ypa hawhta â ngia ngaitapa ta y sih la, apatlapa nata sahma paripa ta y leipa ta, parâpa nata apheipa ta y hra leipa ta, ahryuchhiapa nata hiatliapa ta y khah ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abeipa Zisu Krista ta tlao a tobi u la, nama sapa khopa pipatlohsa nawpa ta khâpa hmah tao khuh vy.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngiapâna liata chiehleipa chyhsa cha a pyh thai u la, â lôhleina kyh liata sei khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chyhsa pakha cha â ngiapâna ta ato nie thei awpa ta pachâ ta, chyhsa chiehleipa deikua cha âhnalasi deita a nie tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ato a niepa ta a nie leipa mohnao khah sy. A nie leipa chhao ta, a niepa sei khah sy. Khazohpa ta ano cha â pyh ha mâh tâh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mohropa chakaotuhpa seituhpa cha ahy ma na châ? Â duah tlyma, a pao tlyma, ano zibeipa hmiakô liata a taopa a châ. Abeipa cha ano a paduasa theipa a châpa vâta, â duah thlâh ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chyhsa pakha ta noh kha cha, noh hropa hlâta pasô via ta, chyhsa hropa ta noh zydua he miakha sai ta a pachâ. Chyhsa to ama pachâna chyu liata ama sia awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noh a chaypa cha Abeipa palyupalih nawpa ta a chaypa a châ. Ato a niepa chhao, Abeipa palyupalih nawpa ta nie ta, Khazohpa lâta alyna bie a hlâ tyh. Nie a taihpa chhao, Abeipa palyupalih nawpa ta a taih ta, Khazohpa lâ alyna bie a hlâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahy hmah keimosasyh châta a hrohpa châ leipa pi ta, ahy hmah keimosasyh châta a thipa châ hra ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eima hroh khiahta cha, Abeipa châta hroh pi ta, eima thipa chhao ta, Abeipa châta a thipa eima châ. Chavâta eima hrohpa chhao ta, eima thipa chhao ta, Abeipa eih eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Krista cha athihpa nata ahrohpa Beipa châ awpa ta, thi ta a hroh heihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, khazia na unawhpa na sei? Khazia na unawhpa na mohnao? Eima zydua heta Khazohpa pachiana dyuchhai hmiakô liata a duah khai awpa eima châ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ei hrona reipa ta ei reih, Abeipa ta a tah; Pakhu to ei hmiakô liata paneih aw ei ta, Paleih to ta Khazohpa ama reithai aw,” tahpa ropa hawhta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eima zydua ta Khazohpa hmiakô liata keimo thâtih eima reih chyu aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chavâta a sei raihrie khao leipa ta, unawhpa lâpi liata achapiana lô tlyma, pakhâna tlyma, sokhâh lei awpa a chhuah ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abeipa Zisu liata pathaih leipa khâpa hmah y vei tahpa a siapa ta ei pahno. Pathaih leipa hawhta a pachâpa châta deikua cha, pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na niepa ta na unawhpa palôh a patypamâ khiahta cha, kyhpachâna lâpi a chhih khao va chi. Ano thi vyuhpa ta Krista ta a thikâ hapa chyhsa cha, parao khah y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmo phapa ta nama pachâpa cha, moleina hawhta pachâ awpa pasaih khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khazohpa khinarâh cha nie nata do kyh châ vei. Siana nata thlalôhna nata Thlahpa Pathaihpa liata alyna zy tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha hawhta Krista chakaotuhpazy cha, Khazohpa ta a pyh ta, chyhsa reithaina chhao ama hlao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chavâta thlalôhna a tlôkhei awpa nata tha a patlô raihriena a châ awpa hmozy a chadai lymâ suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Niepa vâta Khazohpa raihria parao khah y. Hmo to a pathaih khai. Châhrasala niepa ta chyhsa a chapiasa khiahta cha, a nietuhpa cha a do vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na unawhpa a chapia nawpa a châ khiahta cha, sa nie leipa nata kresawhti do leipa pha ta, â chapia thei nawpa hmo khâpa hmah tao leipa a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />He kyh liata ngiapânazie na hneipa cha, Khazohpa nata nâma likah liata a y awpa châta soh mah y. Ano ta pha a tahpa kyh liata anosasyh thailei a pachâsa leipa chyhsa cha a nohlao na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A lôh leipa ta a niepa deikua cha, ngiapâna ta a nie leipa vâta thailei a châ. Khâpa rai ngiapâna tawhta a pua leipa cha moleina a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keimo, thatlôpazy pi heta keimo alyna tlua leipa ta, chiehleipazy ama pachyu leina liata eima bao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eima vaihzy thapatlô sih la, ama pha nawpa taopa ta palysa a chhuah chyu suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Nâma châ pasipasawhtuhpa pasipasawhna cha keima chô liata a tla haw,” tahpa ropa hawhta, Krista chhao khata ano alyna tlua vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlâno ta bie ropa zydua kha eimâ chu hra awpa ta ropa a châ. Chatanachata Biehrai bie hawhta tiamana nata thatlôna hneipa ta hnabeiseihna eima hnei thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tiamana nata thatlôna Khazohpa ta Krista Zisu khozie hawhta nama zydua ta a ryh ngaitapa ta y awpa ta cha bao mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatanachata Khazohpa nata eima Beipa Zisu Krista Paw cha, reihkha tlapa ta nama reithai khoh thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa rônah nawpa ta Krista ta a châ pyhpa hawh ei ta, nâmo chhao a pyh raihrie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ei cha chho ei, pathlatuhpazy hnohta bietai pa-i ta, Khazohpa adona palâsa nawpa ta, Krista cha chopawtaipazy chakaotuhpa ta a vaw ypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatanachata Zenitaizy chhao ta Khazohpa cha a ngiachhiena vâta ama reithai thei hra aw, Biehrai liata, “Zenitaizy hry liata cha reithai aw na ta, Na moh reithaipa ta ei sa aw,” tahpa ropa hawhna khata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hy Zenitaizy saih u, A phopi nata a ly khoh teh u,” tah heih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Zenitai zydua saih u, Abeipa cha reithai teh u; Chyhsa zydua ta, Ano cha reithai mawh ei sy,” a tah heih hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isai chhao ta, “Zese thari kaw pyuh aw ta, Zenitaizy ryureituhpa a vaw pua aw; Ano liata Zenitaizy hnabeiseihna a y aw,” tahpa ta a vaw reih hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlahpa Pathaihpa hmotaotheina zawhzi ta hnabeiseihna hluhpi nama hnei thei nawpa ta, hnabeiseihna Khazohpa ta, ano nama ngâpa hawhta, alyna nata thlalôhna ta cha pabie mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unawh saih u, phana ta bie ei chi ta, sona to hnei ei chi ta, namâ pachu raihrie thei, tahpa keima tlai ta a siapa ta ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kyh thokha liata deikua cha, cha pahnosa heih awpa ei ta, riahpha ngaitapa ta ei roh. Khazohpa ta ngiachhiena eina patosapa zawhzi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khazohpa thâtihpha châta theihthaina chakaona raihria liata, Zenitaizy hry liata Krista Zisu chakaotuhpa châta raopa ei châ. Chatanachata Zenitaizy hmohlâpa cha Thlahpa Pathaihpa ta pathaisa aw ta, a pyh tlâh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa chakaona rai ei hriana kyh liata, Krista Zisu vâta a palai thei nawpa ei hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zenitaizy Khazohpa bie pazyhsa awpa ta Krista ta kei na hmâh ta, cha châta ei biereipa nata ei hmotaopazy dei leipa ta cha, bie hropa rei a chhuah va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Krista thâtihpha chakaona rai cha, ngiana nata hmonoâhpa hmotaotheina nata Khazohpa Thlahpa hmotaotheina zy hmâpa ta, Zerusale nata a chheipâhzy tawhta Eliriku râh taihta ei chho khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, mohropa lôbô bô chiehpa liata o a sapa ei châ lei nawpa ta, Krista moh pado hana su liata cha thâtihpha chho lei awpa ei chhuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A thâtih chho beih leipazy ta hmô aw ei ta, A thei beih leipazy ta ama pahno aw,” tahpa ropa hawhna khata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cha vâna tlai chata nâmo lâ a vy awpa pakhâpa ta khâ ei y tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua cha, he râhzy liana heta hria nawpa su hropa hnei khao leipa na ta, kô hluhpi chhôh nâmo cha vaw tly khohna ei vaw hnei tyhpa vâta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Spânia râh lâ ei siena liata nâmo châ vaw hmô pâ awpa ei chhuah. Chatanachata nama hnohta a pahlaopa ta buakha chhôh a lypa ta y aw na ta, cha khai tawhta ei khitlyna liata chhao eina deichhy thei awpa ei chi ta ei hnabei a seih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua cha, mopathaihpazy deichhyna hmo pie awpa ta Zerusale lâ ei sie chy aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mâsidônia nata Akai râhzy ta, a ly kawpa ta Zerusale liata mopathaihpa dyhchhiepazy châta thyupakhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cha cha a ly kawpa ta ama taopa a châ. Hmeiseih ta la, tao awpa amâ bâhpa rai a châ. Zenitaizy ta thlahpa kyh liata Zuzy amâ hlykhei khiahta cha, khizaw hmozy ta Zuzy ama deichhy hra awpa cha a byuhpa tlai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha hmozy cha tao khaipa ta, thyunazy cha ama ku liata ei hlâ khai tawhta, nâmo cha vaw chapiapa ta Spânia lâ cha ei sie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nâmo lâ ei vy tita, Krista byhnâ kipa chhaota ei vy aw tahpa ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Unawh saih u, tiamapa ta Khazohpa lâ thlah eina chhâkhei awpa ei chi ta, eima Beipa Zisu Krista moh nata Thlahpa kyhpachâna ta ei châ haw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zudia râh liata ngiapâleipazy tawhta ei boh thei nawpa nata Zerusale liata ei chakaona cha mopathaihpazy châta a pyh tlâh a châ thei nawpa ta thlah na chhâkhei teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chatanachata Khazohpa khozie hawhta a ly kawpa ta nâmo lâ a vy aw na ta, nama hnohta a pahlaopa ta tha eina patlô thei aw ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thlalôhna Khazohpa cha nama zydua hnohta y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eima sietanô Phibi, Kenkaria Awnanopa liata chakaotuhpa pahnokheina nâmo lâta ei vaw roh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mopathaihpa a châna nata â phuhpa ta Abeipa liata a vaw ly u la, bao â ngiahna maih liata vaw bao lymâ muh vy. Kei nata chyhsa hluhpi miah a deichhy tyhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Priskilâ nata Akuilâ, Krista Zisu liata ei hrialâhpazy kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ei hrona pabohsa awpa ta rao a dao ngâhpazy châ ei ta, kei ta ama hnohta alyna bie ei reipa dei châ leipa ta, Zenitai awnanopa zydua ta alyna bie ama hlâ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama o liata Awnanopa a pakhypazy chhao kha nâ naohpa muh vy. Ei kho ngaitapa Epenetâ, Asia râh liata Krista a ngiapâ tua chaipa chhao kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nâmo châta a hriapasa ngaitapa Mâri chhao kha nâ naohpa hra muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ei chiheih Andrônikâ nata Zunia, patâhna o liata ei tâlâhpazy kha nâ naohpa muh vy. Âmo cha lyuhchâpazy ta ama pahno kawpazy châ ei ta, kei Krista liata ei y hlâta a y hapazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ampaliatâ, Abeipa liata ei kho ngaitapa kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Krista liata ei hrialâhpa Ubânâ nata ei kho ngaitapa Stâki kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Krista liata chyhsa hmeiseihpa Apele kha nâ naohpa muh vy. Aristôbulâ chhôhkhazy kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ei chiheih Herôdiônâ kha nâ naohpa muh vy. Nâkisâ chhôhkha Abeipa liata a ypazy kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taruphanâ nata Tarôphôsâ, Abeipa châta a hriapasa ngaitapazy kha nâ naohpa muh vy. Kyhpachâpa Pâsi, Abeipa châta a hriapasa ngaitapa kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abeipa liata atlyhpa Rufu kha nâ naohpa u la, a nô, keima châ chhao ta nô a châpa kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinkritâ, Phalekô, Hame, Patôbâ, Hamâ nata ama hnohta unawh a ypazy chhao kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philôkâ, Zulia, Neria nata a sietanô nata Ôlipâ nata ama hnohta mopathaihpa a ypa zydua kha nâ naohpa muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Apahnâna pathaihpa ta a naoh raihrie tyh muh vy. Krista Awnanopa zydua ta ama châ naoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unawh saih u, biezyhpa eima cha pachupa chakhiapa ta, achhaihna taopa ta, paona châ sokhâhtuhpazy tawhta a vaih awpa ta ei châ haw ei. Âmo cha a kâsai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha hawhpa chyhsazy cha, eima Beipa Zisu Krista chakao leipa ei ta, âmo py a chakaopa tlao châ ei ta, reikah pahniapa nata papyupahly thainazy ta chyhsa pha molopazy ama dôvei tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khazohpa bie a zyhpa nama châzie cha mo to pahnopa a châ. Chavâta nama chô liata ei ly ngaita. Hmo phapa lâta so u la, moleina lâta deikua cha, a so leipa nama châ awpa ei khoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlalôhna Khazohpa ta Sâtâ cha nama phei ry liata a tlysao patoh aw. Eima Beipa Zisu Krista ngiachhiena nama hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ei hrialâhpa Timawthy ta a châ naoh ei. Ei chiheih Lukia, Zasaw nata Sôsipatâ zy chhao ta ama châ naoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei Tertia, he châ rohtuhpa heta, Abeipa moh ta ei châ naoh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ei tlôna paw, Kaiâ, Awnanopa a pakhy tyhna o hneituhpa ta a châ naoh ei. Khihpi sôh avaotuhpa Erastâ nata eima unawhpa Kuatâ ta ama châ naoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eima Beipa Zisu Krista ngiachhiena nama zydua hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kô hluhpi nyupa ta a ypa bienyupa liata aluahna zipa ta, ei thâtihpha reipa nata Zisu Krista bie ei chhopa hawhta tha châ patlô theituhpa Khazohpa hnohta rônahna y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua cha, bienyupa palâhâhpa ta a y haw. Chyhsazy ta a ngiapâ ei sala, a bie ama zyh thei nawpa ta, chhâzaw Khazohpa ta biepie ta, bienyupa cha hrohsopazy châbu hmâpa ta phopi zydua hnohta pahnosapa ta a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khazohpa sopa a y chhôhpa hnohta, Zisu Krista vâta chhâzaw ta rônahna y mawh sy! Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
